    {
      "post_id": "580352273001410560",
      "text": "NEWS: 'Emergency Emergency' was the final distress call that was sent from the cockpit of flight #4U9525  - @PollyR_Aviation",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 12:55:38 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580356210320228352",
      "text": "@airlivenet @PollyR_Aviation @crislomb Looks terribly off course on a map. Nothing earlier? Like much earlier?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:11:17 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803522730014106e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580368858999078912",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @larsst plus af447 was exceptionnal weather conditions",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 14:01:33 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803686574502011e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580369539805929472",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @damienramage With iced sensors it won't level off. Apparently a computer glitch - pilot would need to override system manually",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 14:04:15 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803686574502011e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580361188007084032",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet immediately manual (autopilot off), throttle, oxygen masks + passngrs, radio call. All that in 20 seconds? #4U9525",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:31:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803599251818701e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580370200274583553",
      "text": "@damienramage @PascalSyn GW flight had same descent rate as near crash LH flight. Check https://t.co/m2UVxkJqyC or https://t.co/3jPBYgeqqA",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 14:06:53 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803688589990789e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580363250925215745",
      "text": "@damienramage I've seen friends with nasal oxygen masks on (General Avation), just to fly over the Channel :) http://t.co/nVB4NILrCx",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:39:16 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803594647815004e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580355626926231552",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet No, then you would say PANPAN. Trust me, I'm a pilot! Besides: Mayday is when lives are in danger...",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:08:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80354874833023e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580358055185027072",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet Normal descend rate for A320 is 2500fpm. Now 4000fpm (for 8 minutes) which is much, but contrallable. #u4u9525",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:18:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803567125211873e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580362340610236416",
      "text": "@damienramage radio call to passengers: not a priority at all !!",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:35:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80361570334675e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580372485566238720",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet From Airbus FlightOps: When the cabin altitude rises above 14 000 feet, the oxygen masks will deploy automatically",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 14:15:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80361570334675e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580356854271873024",
      "text": "@airlivenet @PollyR_Aviation So sad...prayers to the families and friends...",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:13:51 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803522730014106e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580359692922298368",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet true...",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:25:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803594647815004e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580354874833022976",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet it’s a scale. Emergency &lt; Mayday",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:05:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80354345935487e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580361570334674944",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet radio call then passengers, no ? 20 sec isn’t much… it takes me longer to tweet sometimes ;-)",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:32:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80361188007084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580356785065844736",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet or think you do ? or it hasn’t been assessed ?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:13:34 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803556269262316e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580358416478167040",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet Plus they stayed more or less constant speed, which means they reduced throttle, so they were in control #u4u9525",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:20:03 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803567125211873e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580359925181870080",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet what’s the exact procedure btw ? What altitude would you drop down to ? at which rate of descent ?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:26:03 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803594647815004e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580358454881185792",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet exactly. So emergency would be appropriate, for example in case of cabin decompression, right ?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:20:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803580551850271e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580365061463629824",
      "text": "@PascalSyn that's just for the high",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:46:27 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803632509252157e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580359262909644800",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet That would certainly explain why pilots set steap descend. Maybe they passed too quickly (oxygen masks?) #u4u9525",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:23:25 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803584548811858e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580352871180476416",
      "text": "“@airlivenet: NEWS: 'Emergency Emergency' was the final distress call that was sent from the cockpit of flight #4U9525  - @PollyR_Aviation”",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 12:58:01 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803522730014106e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580360410034995200",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet At that altitude you have about 20 sec before you pass out. They started steep descend, reduced engine... #4U9525",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:27:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803596567506534e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580359318119280640",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet real question is, how long before the crash did they call out the emergency",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:23:38 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80358644170154e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580352527885008897",
      "text": "@airlivenet @PollyR_Aviation is that a normal call in this situation ?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 12:56:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803522730014106e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580359656750653441",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet if they had, it’s likely the descent rate would’ve been steeper and the speed not reduce, no ?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:24:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803592629096448e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580356712521187329",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @airlivenet but isn’t declaring an emergency the proper procedure if you still have control of the situation ?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:13:17 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803556269262316e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580365319732129792",
      "text": "@damienramage yes, and they have a bottle behind them with this tube connected. But it looks very stupid LOL",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:47:29 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803650614636298e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580365364279771137",
      "text": "@PascalSyn @damienramage @airlivenet What about icy sensors and software telling autopilot to dive as happened with AF447?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:47:40 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.80361188007084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580352585640603648",
      "text": "RT @airlivenet: NEWS: 'Emergency Emergency' was the final distress call that was sent from the cockpit of flight #4U9525  - @PollyR_Aviation",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 12:56:53 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803522730014106e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580359464781500416",
      "text": "@damienramage @airlivenet By the way: Cabin pressure loss in an airliner is a classic case for MAYDAY ! #4u9525",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:24:13 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803584548811858e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580368657450201088",
      "text": "@larsst @damienramage I don't know about that. Graphs don't show a sign of leveling off at a certain altitude.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 14:00:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803653642797711e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580354345935486976",
      "text": "I doubt any pilot would say 'Emergency', but rather 'Mayday' RT \"@airlivenet NEWS: 'Emergency Emergency' was the final distress call #4U9525",
